<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">flee</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">flee</ansi> command attempts to run away from combat into another area.

If successful, foes will not chase you. You must escape every foe
attacking you, however.

Your chance of escaping depends on how fast you are relative to
each attacker — a quicker combatant has a much better chance of
breaking away. You cannot flee while grappled or prone.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help grapple</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help combat</ansi>
